source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A space before a candidate refuses it without killing the opener, so Jira bolds across it; jiro reads one bold effect holding the inner asterisk.
-- input.jira --
*a *b*
-- rendered.html --
<p><b>a *b</b></p>
-- want.md --
**a \*b**
-- warnings.json --
[]
